      "instruction": "Use approved glossary term 'AI-маттинг' instead of 'AI-маттинг'? Actually approved is 'AI matting' => 'AI-маттинг' is acceptable, but ensure consistency. However, the approved glossary says 'AI 抠像' => 'AI matting', so 'AI-маттинг' is fine. No issue."
